### Create Professional Services
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/services
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: jwt={{cookie}}

{
    "name": "Terapia",
    "price": 350,
    "durationMinutes": 60,
    "description": "Sessão de terapia comportamental."
}

### Read Professional Services
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/services/me
Cookie: jwt={{cookie}}

### Read Professional Available Slots
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/professionals/fefd15be-3a1e-45c5-8ced-fd98f938d7e5/available-slots?serviceId=67a13d7a-d535-4681-8963-42764779ec73&date=2026-09-11

### Create Appointment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "professionalId": "fefd15be-3a1e-45c5-8ced-fd98f938d7e5",
    "serviceId": "67a13d7a-d535-4681-8963-42764779ec73",
    "clientName": "Elon Musk",
    "clientEmail": "elonmusk@hotmail.com",
    "clientPhone": "10987654321",
    "startTime": "2026-09-11T13:00:00+00:00"
}

### Cancel Appointment By Professional Logged
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/5ef9dad9-2fe5-4106-be23-ea5fe784572b/cancel-by-professional
Cookie: jwt={{cookie}}

### Complete Appointment By Professional Logged
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/5ef9dad9-2fe5-4106-be23-ea5fe784572b/complete
Cookie: jwt={{cookie}}

### No-Show Appointment By Professional Logged
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/5ef9dad9-2fe5-4106-be23-ea5fe784572b/no-show
Cookie: jwt={{cookie}}

### Cancel Appointment By Client AccessToken
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/dce2357b-c7bd-4472-b948-7c9e9ec6683e/cancel-by-client?accessToken=e444d1221a544dd5a43d679908091bb8

### Upload Professional Avatar Photo
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/professionals/me/photo
Cookie: jwt={{cookie}}

### Get Paged All Professionals
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/professionals?page=1&pageSize=10